<title>USA: World Color says Thomas Pierno named CFO.</title>
<headline>World Color says Thomas Pierno named CFO.</headline>
<dateline>GREENWICH, Conn. 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>World Color Press Inc said Thursday that Thomas Pierno had been named chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Previously, Pierno, 35, was controller and senior vice president-finance at the printing company.</p>
</text>
